    "summary": "Four continued TinyLM checkpoints: arithmetic-only training, attribute replay, clean labels and intentionally corrupted labels.",
    "scope": "Inspect forgetting/replay trade-offs and wrong-label effects from a shared controlled SFT initialization.",
    "limitations": [
      "All tasks are generated attributes or small 0–7 addition records; no general arithmetic or continual-learning result is established.",
